OL,3,GNEWSAHairy Biker's belongings sold for
OL,4,A#19k
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eclectic collection of items that
OL,7,Fbelonged to the Hairy Biker Dave Myers
OL,8,Fhave been sold for about #19,000 at an
OL,9,Fauction.
OL,11,FMyers, who died aged 66 from cancer in
OL,12,F2024, was most famed for travelling the
OL,13,Fworld as one half of the cooking double
OL,14,Fact alongside friend Si King.
OL,16,FOf just over 300 items, about a third
OL,17,Fremained unsold at Newbury's Special
OL,18,FAuction Services, including leather
OL,19,Fshoes that he wore during his
OL,20,Fappearances on Strictly Come Dancing in
OL,21,F2013.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
